{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Account for parents that ended in earlier invocations.** This set is cleared per invocation, so a retained callback completed after its context was previously exported is attached to that already-ended context, producing a child outside its parent's lifetime. Retain the operation history and compare the parent's terminal timestamp with the child's completion timestamp, falling back to `Workflow` when the parent ended first; update the retained-child test accordingly.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-Rmxk","finding_digest":"c4e807746abf7c339d92c69579449ce4a8d2dc101028b9a7d9a74c854725d94b","finding_id":"arf_v1_ytuao5dkx56dhhmsy2kxsre44s","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::resolveoperationparentcontext::ended-parent-containment","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::resolveoperationparentcontext::ended-parent-containment","line":729,"observation_digest":"9d3a14ee1293f16dca0dca76704321e553df7b2e9da2850c5befe2e5f0cea465","observation_id":"aro_v1_tu5bj3qsspyw3sqnzj3haqzb4v","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ytuao5dkx56dhhmsy2kxsre44s","published_at":"2026-10-14T02:06:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_aizsfk7aledx5gds6mhh7ztbd6","reviewed_base_sha":"08ba0f6e29d7faaaaa99a6acde407db9c9854e2f","reviewed_head_sha":"6c328e48d6e5d9b0ed4b7a82d2e9c70a65120734","reviewer":"codex","start_line":729,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_cfhspdy6apjrbvxnbvn6mmg2ua","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T02:06:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
